# Quran Story Universe — environment template
# Copy to .env for Vite-based builds, or inject via window.__QSU_ENV__ for static serve.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_DATA_MODE=local

# VITE_DATA_MODE options:
#   local    — load src/data/*.json (default, no credentials required)
#   supabase — use Supabase auth + review persistence (falls back to local if URL/key missing)

# Supabase mode requires:
# 1. Run supabase/migrations/001_content_review_actions.sql
# 2. Create auth users + reviewer_profiles rows (see docs/supabase_setup_steps.md)
# 3. Set VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

# Review actions in Supabase mode are audit-only — they do NOT auto-approve public content.
